  "summary": "Extract version-1 authorization outcome semantics into exact pinned data without changing existing hashes.",
  "why": "Luis approved extracting fixed authorization rules into identified data. RED 77eaf346: 23 expected failures, 71 passes. GREEN a7c54fa8: seven scoped files. Pinned data replaces handwritten mapping, precedence and trigger selection without changing old policy/evaluation hashes or public signatures. Gates: 160 control/conformance tests, 273 protocol/history/check tests, and 99 installed-wheel control tests using existing dependencies. Local wheel and sdist build and pass twine. The report binds the exact tests, artifact hashes and non-claims. This revision closes pending manifest/document drift without weakening validation. No release, fresh dependency installation, full repository gate, caller override, stable grammar, new epoch, independent interpreter or Assent cutover. Interleaved Shop commits are excluded.",
